t Shift Drift", "keywords": ["gliding", "flying", "Challenge", "LSD", "highscore"], "long_description": "# The most thrilling and high-speed VR gliding game\n\n\nSpread your arms, glide through narrow gaps between terrains and obstacles to score big!\n\nExplore endless uncharted realms and feel the ultimate freedom and exhilaration of flight.\n\n{1152277559579439}\n# Experience Unmatched VR Immersion\n\n\nTake full control of the gliding by tilting and spreading your arms. Feel every gust of wind!\n{546401181779274}\n# Easy to Learn, Hard to Master\n\n\nSimple arm movements to start, but limitless techniques to perfect!\n{635752632259829}\n\n\n# High Risk, High Return\n\n\nCloser flights to obstacles mean higher scores, more adrenaline, and bigger thrills!\n\n\n{1334180918008308}\n# Endless Content to Keep You Engaged\n\nUnlock new gear with every mission you complete, bringing fresh challenges to every gliding!\n\n{1363203888420717}\n**Lift into the unknown, Shift through danger, Drift across endless horizons.**\n\nBecome a Rifter today and dive into the **ultimate VR gliding adventure!**\n\n", "short_description": "LiftShiftDrift is a standalone VR game for Meta Quest. Experience high-speed gliding, immersive exploration, and thrilling challenges as you create your own adventure in a stunning wireless VR world!"}]}, "developer_name": "KapeHorn", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.liftshiftdrift.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.liftshiftdrift.com/terms-of-service-1", "publisher_name": "KapeHorn", "support_website_url": "https://www.liftshiftdrift.com/faq-1", "website_url": "https://www.liftshiftdrift.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], 